<title>UK: Bankers Trust to lead manage Jamaica's dollar bond.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust to lead manage Jamaica's dollar bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust told Reuters on Tuesday it had won the mandate to lead manage a dollar bond for Jamaica and investor presentations would start in mid-June.</p>
<p>&quot;The mandate is confirmed but we have no further details at this stage,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;The roadshow will start in the second or third week of June,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>The deal will be denominated in dollars.</p>
<p>-- Hayley Pienaar, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
